title: "industrialstats"
abstract: >-
  Industrial statistics and design of experiments for Python, including
  factorial and fractional factorial designs, randomized designs, screening,
  response surface methodology, optimal designs, statistical analysis,
  diagnostics, power calculations, and visualization utilities.
